---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q7"
---
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |  Sort: shipping.supp_nation ASC NULLS LAST, shipping.cust_nation ASC NULLS LAST, shipping.l_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Projection: shipping.supp_nation, shipping.cust_nation, shipping.l_year, sum(shipping.volume) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[shipping.supp_nation, shipping.cust_nation, shipping.l_year]], aggr=[[sum(shipping.volume)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: shipping                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |         Projection: n1.n_name AS supp_nation, n2.n_name AS cust_nation, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_shipdate) AS l_year, mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_discount) AS volume                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.customer.c_nationkey = n2.n_nationkey AND (n1.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR n1.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE"))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_nationkey = n1.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.customer.c_custkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.orders.o_orderkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier.s_suppkey = mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                     TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount, l_shipdate], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.lineitem.l_shipdate BETWEEN CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32) AND CAST(Utf8("1996-12-31") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                   TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                 TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |               Filter: n1.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") OR n1.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                   TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") OR mysql.tpch_sf1.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |             Filter: n2.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR n2.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                 TableScan: mysql.tpch_sf1.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], full_filters=[mysql.tpch_sf1.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR mysql.tpch_sf1.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=mysql compute_context=host=benchmark-mysql.dataplatform.svc.cluster.local,port=3306,db=tpch_sf1,user=root base_sql=SELECT `shipping`.`supp_nation`, `shipping`.`cust_nation`, `shipping`.`l_year`, sum(`shipping`.`volume`) AS `revenue` FROM (SELECT `n1`.`n_name` AS `supp_nation`, `n2`.`n_name` AS `cust_nation`, EXTRACT(YEAR FROM `lineitem`.`l_shipdate`) AS `l_year`, (`lineitem`.`l_extendedprice` * (1 - `lineitem`.`l_discount`)) AS `volume` FROM `tpch_sf1`.`supplier` INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`lineitem` ON (`supplier`.`s_suppkey` = `lineitem`.`l_suppkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`orders` ON (`orders`.`o_orderkey` = `lineitem`.`l_orderkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`customer` ON (`customer`.`c_custkey` = `orders`.`o_custkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`nation` AS `n1` ON (`supplier`.`s_nationkey` = `n1`.`n_nationkey`) INNER JOIN `tpch_sf1`.`nation` AS `n2` ON ((`customer`.`c_nationkey` = `n2`.`n_nationkey`) AND (((`n1`.`n_name` = 'FRANCE') AND (`n2`.`n_name` = 'GERMANY')) OR ((`n1`.`n_name` = 'GERMANY') AND (`n2`.`n_name` = 'FRANCE')))) WHERE (`lineitem`.`l_shipdate` BETWEEN CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE) AND CAST('1996-12-31' AS DATE)) AND ((`n1`.`n_name` = 'FRANCE') OR (`n1`.`n_name` = 'GERMANY')) AND ((`n2`.`n_name` = 'GERMANY') OR (`n2`.`n_name` = 'FRANCE'))) AS `shipping` GROUP BY `shipping`.`supp_nation`, `shipping`.`cust_nation`, `shipping`.`l_year` ORDER BY `shipping`.`supp_nation` ASC, `shipping`.`cust_nation` ASC, `shipping`.`l_year` ASC |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
